        "id": "p19-q1-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "In which of the two exams was his result better? Justify your answer.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Vietnamese: his higher $z$-score shows stronger performance relative to the group.",
          "worked": "His Vietnamese score was $2$ standard deviations above its mean, compared with $1.5$ standard deviations above the mean in Chinese. Since higher test scores are better, he performed better relative to the group in Vietnamese.",
